        "accession_number": "0000950170-25-100235",
        "filing_date": "2025-07-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Founded in 1975, we develop and support software, services, devices, and solutions that deliver new value for customers and help people and businesses realize their full potential.",
        "start_character": 1090,
        "end_character": 1270
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000950170-25-100235",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000950170-25-100235-99d693f6c1544144",
        "accession_number": "0000950170-25-100235",
        "filing_date": "2025-07-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "These changes align our segments with how we currently manage our business, most notably bringing the commercial components of Microsoft 365 together in the Productivity and Business Processes segment.",
        "start_character": 6852,
        "end_character": 7053
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000950170-25-100235",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000950170-25-100235-99d693f6c1544144",
        "accession_number": "0000950170-25-100235",
        "filing_date": "2025-07-30",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also compete with other providers of entertainment services such as video streaming platforms.",
        "start_character": 25537,
        "end_character": 25634
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000950170-25-100235",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000950170-25-100235-99d693f6c1544144",
        "accession_number": "0000950170-25-100235",
        "filing_date": "2025-07-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also sell commercial and consumer products and services directly to customers, such as cloud services, search, and gaming, through our digital marketplaces and online stores.",
        "start_character": 33791,
        "end_character": 33968
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000950170-25-100235",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000950170-25-100235-99d693f6c1544144",
        "accession_number": "0000950170-25-100235",
        "filing_date": "2025-07-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We develop and support a broad portfolio of technology solutions for individuals and businesses, focusing on secure, trusted, and innovative platforms and tools that meet evolving customer needs across cloud computing, productivity and collaboration, and personal computing.",
        "start_character": 270,
        "end_character": 544
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000950170-25-100235",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000950170-25-100235-99d693f6c1544144",
        "accession_number": "0000950170-25-100235",
        "filing_date": "2025-07-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We develop most of our products and services internally which allows us to maintain competitive advantages that come from product differentiation and closer technical control over our products and services.",
        "start_character": 29589,
        "end_character": 29795
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000950170-25-100235",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000950170-25-100235-99d693f6c1544144",
        "accession_number": "0000950170-25-100235",
        "filing_date": "2025-07-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We make significant investments in research and development for new and existing products, services, and technologies, including tools and platforms spanning digital work and life experiences, cloud computing, AI, devices, security, and operating systems.",
        "start_character": 29333,
        "end_character": 29588
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000950170-25-100235",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000950170-25-100235-99d693f6c1544144",
        "accession_number": "0000950170-25-100235",
        "filing_date": "2025-07-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We monitor regulatory developments around the world and implement policies, controls, and technical safeguards so that our operations, products, and services meet applicable legal standards.",
        "start_character": 41158,
        "end_character": 41348
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000950170-25-100235",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000950170-25-100235-99d693f6c1544144",
        "accession_number": "0000950170-25-100235",
        "filing_date": "2025-07-30",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We offer an array of services, including cloud-based solutions that provide customers with software, services, platforms, and content, and we provide solution support and consulting services.",
        "start_character": 1271,
        "end_character": 1462
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000950170-25-100235",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000950170-25-100235-99d693f6c1544144",
        "accession_number": "0000950170-25-100235",
        "filing_date": "2025-07-30",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We operate our business and report our financial performance using three segments: Productivity and Business Processes, Intelligent Cloud, and More Personal Computing.",
        "start_character": 6291,
        "end_character": 6458
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000950170-25-100235",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000950170-25-100235-99d693f6c1544144",
        "accession_number": "0000950170-25-100235",
        "filing_date": "2025-07-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We plan to continue to make significant investments in a broad range of product research and development activities, and as appropriate, we will coordinate our research and development across operating segments and leverage the results across the company.",
        "start_character": 30296,
        "end_character": 30551
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000950170-25-100235",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000950170-25-100235-99d693f6c1544144",
        "accession_number": "0000950170-25-100235",
        "filing_date": "2025-07-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "While we employ much of our internally-developed intellectual property in our products and services, we also engage in outbound licensing of specific patented technologies that are incorporated into licensees’ products.",
        "start_character": 31050,
        "end_character": 31269
      }
    ]
